      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Organise. Syndicated copies merge into source families (MinHash), articles cluster into a timeline. Haiku labels stances. Mainstream = majority of\nestablished + primary sources; an 'other side' needs a party with standing or >= 5 % coverage.",
      "originalText": "Organise. Syndicated copies merge into source families (MinHash), articles cluster into a timeline. Haiku labels stances. Mainstream = majority of\nestablished + primary sources; an 'other side' needs a party with standing or >= 5 % coverage.",
