      "text": "Claims. Haiku extracts up to 12 checkable claims with who says them. Existing fact-checks (ClaimReview) are matched first and mapped onto the scale.",
      "originalText": "Claims. Haiku extracts up to 12 checkable claims with who says them. Existing fact-checks (ClaimReview) are matched first and mapped onto the scale.",
