      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Verify. Evidence passages go to Haiku (Sonnet for at most 3 high-risk claims). Code then checks every quote is verbatim in a fetched document and that\nVerified / False have 2+ independent strong sources. Otherwise: Unproven.",
      "originalText": "Verify. Evidence passages go to Haiku (Sonnet for at most 3 high-risk claims). Code then checks every quote is verbatim in a fetched document and that\nVerified / False have 2+ independent strong sources. Otherwise: Unproven.",
