      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Publish. Haiku narrates with evidence markers; unmarked sentences are dropped. The guard applies snippet limits, disclaimers and nofollow links, holds\nliving-person allegations for review, and writes every rating to the hash-chained audit log.",
      "originalText": "Publish. Haiku narrates with evidence markers; unmarked sentences are dropped. The guard applies snippet limits, disclaimers and nofollow links, holds\nliving-person allegations for review, and writes every rating to the hash-chained audit log.",
